From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ashwin Devi Srinivasan <ashwin@ashds.dev>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:33:19 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Name the mojito device watermark

The app looks up the device watermark by Build.DEVICE, and only ships an
entry for sunny. The sunny tree reports mojito as ro.product.device, so
the lookup fell back to the generic SHOT ON MI PHONE watermark. Add the
same Redmi Note 10 entry for mojito.
---
 res/values/strings.xml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/res/values/strings.xml b/res/values/strings.xml
index 27a7bb42..fbc8ac07 100644
--- a/res/values/strings.xml
+++ b/res/values/strings.xml
@@ -460,6 +460,7 @@ and adjust preferences automatically"</string>
     <string name="back_merlin_global">4:REDMI NOTE 9:AI QUAD CAMERA</string>
     <string name="back_merlin_india">4:REDMI NOTE 9:AI QUAD CAMERA</string>
     <string name="back_merlinnfc_global">4:REDMI NOTE 9:AI QUAD CAMERA</string>
+    <string name="back_mojito">4:REDMI NOTE 10</string>
     <string name="back_monet">4:MI10 LITE 5G:AI QUAD CAMERA</string>
     <string name="back_nabu">1000:XIAOMI PAD 5</string>
     <string name="back_odin">3:XIAOMI MIX 4</string>
